  designNotes: 'Non-Disclosure Agreement. Discard 1 (Corporate pays with capital),
    then Blackout for 2 Days on target enemy creature: its ability and its effects
    (arrival, Dawn and Dusk, retaliation, Last Will) are switched off. Silences the
    Shadow Ops. tricks and the Myth sacrifices alike.'
